  "body": {
    "focus": "Both build-gate judge prompts (src/daemon/steps/build-step/render.ts renderStandaloneValidatePrompt and src/prompts/build/validate-task.md) let the judge read the repository with read-only commands as well as read tools, still telling it not to run the typecheck or tests and not to change anything, so a codex judge can read. A trivial standalone build's validate prompt carries the build's stated scope (the standalone focus), passed from src/daemon/steps/build-step/phases/validate.ts. The prompt test pinning the old wording is updated; tests show both prompts permit read-only commands and the trivial prompt includes the scope. Implements ISSUE-ae2d83c6ab06c595.",
    "producesLld": false,
    "commit": "00f14111",
