        "passed": true
      }
    ],
    "summary": "Commit 687395c8: both judge prompts allow read-only commands (cat, rg, ls, git diff, git log) beside read tools and still forbid running the typecheck/tests or changing anything; a trivial standalone prompt renders the focus as \"## Stated scope\" (passed from phases/validate.ts). Tests: render.test.ts (wording + scope section) and build-start.test.ts (the trivial validate passes the focus to the judge); four falsifying mutations each fail a test. Full sweep: the same 2 pre-existing failures as before (sqlite-driver, review-decision), nothing new. Live: on the daemon at 687395c8 the codex judge read the repository and judged the change.",
